<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Being (a) shareholder(s) of the Company holding ____________ ordinary
shares respectively hereby appoint</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid; width: 91%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center; width: 4%">of</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid; width: 5%">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>or failing him/her</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center">of</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">or failing him/her the duly appointed chairman of the EGM (the &ldquo;<B>Chairman</B>&rdquo;)
as my/our proxy to vote for me/us and on my/our behalf at the extraordinary general meeting of the shareholders of the Company (the &ldquo;<B>EGM</B>&rdquo;)
to be held at 10 P.M. on December 20, 2024, Beijing time (9 A.M. on December 20, 2024, U.S. Eastern time) at 2501 Central Plaza, 227 Huangpi
North Road, Shanghai, People&rsquo;s Republic of China, 200003, and at any adjournment of the EGM. My proxy is instructed to vote on a
poll on the resolutions in respect of the matters specified in the Notice of the EGM as indicated below:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

