    <TD STYLE="width: 69%"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">every five (5) ordinary shares with a par value of US$0.00000939586994067732
each in the Company&rsquo;s issued and unissued share capital be and are hereby consolidated into one (1) ordinary share (each a &ldquo;<B>Consolidated
Ordinary Share</B>&rdquo;) with a par value of US$0.0000469793497033866 and every five (5) shares with a par value of US$0.00000939586994067732
each of such class or classes (however designated) as the board of directors of the Company may determine in accordance with memorandum
and articles of association of the Company in the Company&rsquo;s issued and unissued share capital be and are hereby consolidated into
one (1) share (together with the Consolidated Ordinary Shares, the &ldquo;<B>Consolidated Shares</B>&rdquo;) with a par value of US$0.0000469793497033866
(together, the &ldquo;<B>Share Consolidation</B>&rdquo;) and such Consolidated Shares shall rank pari passu in all respects with each
other and have the rights and privileges and be subject to the restrictions as contained in the second amended and restated memorandum
and articles of association of the Company currently in effect (the &ldquo;<B>M&amp;A</B>&rdquo;); and</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 1%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center; width: 6%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 1%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center; width: 8%">&nbsp;</TD>
