    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">the Company&rsquo;s registered office provider be instructed
to make all necessary filings with the Registrar of Companies in the Cayman Islands in connection with the Share Consolidation; and</FONT></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
