    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">the Company&rsquo;s share registrar and/or transfer agent be
instructed to update the register of members of the Company and that upon the surrender to the Company of the existing share certificates
(if any) that they be cancelled and that any Director be instructed to prepare, sign, seal and deliver on behalf of the Company new share
certificates accordingly.</FONT></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
